        {
          "id": 718599077,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "If it helps I have these notes:\n<pre>\nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/wikis/Development/SubmittingPatches \ngit checkout -b my-branch-name upstream/master\ngit push downstream HEAD\nAmend:\ngit commit -a --amend\ngit push downstream +HEAD\nRebase?\nIt looks like git pull --rebase upstream master followed by git push origin +HEAD should work.\n</pre>",
